<title>JAPAN: Mitsui Fudosan down on gloomy earnings forecast.</title>
<headline>Mitsui Fudosan down on gloomy earnings forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsui Fudosan Co Ltd shares fell in Friday morning trade after it forecast a parent current loss of 70.30 billion yen for the year to March 31, 1997, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 0036 GMT, the shares were down 20 yen at 1,390 yen, with volume of 903,000 shares, making them the eighth most heavily traded issue on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
